# D9 (ruling 2026-09-30): the thesis UKF (AP_NavUKF, ~/ardupilot_ukf) as the ACTIVE estimator.
# Use only via sim/tools/closed_loop_run.sh with UKF=1 (ARDUPILOT_TREE=~/ardupilot_ukf). EKF3 keeps
